cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "meta-analysis.cz: harmonised estimate-level data from meta-analyses in economics"
message: >-
  LICENCE: the CC-BY-4.0 below covers EVERYTHING published here — the datasets,
  their CSV and Parquet conversions, the pooled harmonised table, the codebooks,
  the documentation and the deposited papers. You may use, adapt and redistribute
  any of it for any purpose, including commercially and including as training data
  for machine-learning models. See https://meta-analysis.cz/LICENSE.
  The only condition is credit. If you use the collection, cite it. If you use an
  individual dataset, cite the paper it was assembled for — every dataset entry in
  /api/v1/datasets.json carries that paper's title, authors and DOI, and a
  rights_status field. That is how attribution under CC BY is satisfied here.
