repository-code: "https://github.com/tjhavranek/meta-analysis.cz"
url: "https://meta-analysis.cz"
abstract: >-
  Estimate-level data from meta-analyses in economics and the social sciences,
  with the study and design characteristics hand-coded for each original paper.
  Forty-five datasets holding 66,683 rows in the converted source
  files, 55,274 estimates after each paper's own analysis
  selection, and a harmonised table pooling 49,669 of them across
  41 literatures. Each dataset ships a column-level codebook. Column
  mappings were resolved arithmetically, by requiring that the effect divided by
  its standard error reproduce the t-statistic each dataset already reports, and
  otherwise from each paper's own replication code, or against its published
  results by hand where no code exists. All 41 pooled literatures are verified.
keywords:
  - meta-analysis
  - publication bias
  - research synthesis
  - economics
  - effect size
  - replication
license: CC-BY-4.0
